      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">UpCloud is a Finnish cloud infrastructure provider known for its maxIOPS block storage — a guarantee, not a marketing line, on the IOPS you can pull from a volume. Founded in 2011, UpCloud operates 8 datacenters spanning Helsinki, London, Frankfurt, Amsterdam, San Jose, Chicago, Singapore, and Sydney, with hourly billing and a clean REST API. Pricing starts at $5/mo for a 1 vCPU / 1GB / 25GB maxIOPS plan.</p>
