      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ maxIOPS block storage — guaranteed I/O performance, not best-effort</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 8 datacenters across EU / US / APAC (Helsinki, London, Frankfurt, Amsterdam, San Jose, Chicago, Singapore, Sydney)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Hourly billing — true pay-per-use, no monthly lock-in</li>
